  "portfolioEtf": "Current date: 2026-06-13

Build a draft portfolio under these parameters:
- Budget: $10,000
- Risk profile: balanced [DEFAULT]
- Time horizon: 1y_plus [DEFAULT]
- Positions: 6 [DEFAULT]
- Asset scope: diversified_etf_building_blocks [DEFAULT]
